{"type":"user","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"tool_use_id":"toolu_019xBMU4thPzHZuL4zf5pGhb","type":"tool_result","content":"1\t# Empty KB Placeholder\n2\t\n3\tThis placeholder exists only because the installed TITO research workflow\n4\trequires `MANIFEST.source.documents` to contain at least one Markdown document.\n5\t\n6\tThis file contains no bibliographic evidence, no project result, no engineering\n7\tmethod claim, and no source material for public report prose. It must not be\n8\tcited as evidence for blast-vibration standards, charge-window definitions,\n9\tcomponent attenuation models, waveform processing, response spectra, PLAXIS\n10\tinput requirements, or any AR-S2J2J project result.\n11\t\n12\tFor substantive claims, TITO research sessions should use external sources\n13\tfound during the research pass, or future approved KB documents that contain\n14\treal source material.\n15\t"}]},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"28219691-6b67-4fbf-b214-045292e7efcf","uuid":"51dbdff6-dbac-4531-bf32-91aca6d0ce6c","timestamp":"2026-07-06T20:51:40.425Z","tool_use_result":{"type":"text","file":{"filePath":"/Users/averrik/Cloud/github/projects/AR-S2J2J.R/TITO/kb/EMPTY-KB.md","content":"# Empty KB Placeholder\n\nThis placeholder exists only because the installed TITO research workflow\nrequires `MANIFEST.source.documents` to contain at least one Markdown document.\n\nThis file contains no bibliographic evidence, no project result, no engineering\nmethod claim, and no source material for public report prose. It must not be\ncited as evidence for blast-vibration standards, charge-window definitions,\ncomponent attenuation models, waveform processing, response spectra, PLAXIS\ninput requirements, or any AR-S2J2J project result.\n\nFor substantive claims, TITO research sessions should use external sources\nfound during the research pass, or future approved KB documents that contain\nreal source material.\n","numLines":15,"startLine":1,"totalLines":15}}}
